## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Kubernetes Namespace:**
> The current plan deploys all resources in a dedicated Kubernetes Namespace (`zapier`). If you are running existing resources on the default namespace, we should delete them first before applying Terraform to avoid port conflicts and resource duplication.

> [!WARNING]
> **Base64 Secrets in Terraform:**
> Unlike raw Kubernetes YAML where secrets must be manually base64 encoded (e.g., `DATABASE_URL` in `secret.yaml`), Terraform accepts plain-text values and performs the encoding automatically when communicating with the K8s API. We will define sensitive variables in a `.tfvars` file (which is git-ignored) to demonstrate secure secrets management.

