## Proposed Folder Structure

We will create a structured Terraform directory in the root of the project:

```text
terraform/
├── providers.tf            # Configures local kubeconfig and minikube contexts
├── variables.tf            # Global variables (namespace, docker image tags, etc.)
├── main.tf                 # Orchestrates database instances and microservices
├── outputs.tf              # Returns Ingress URLs and service hostnames
├── terraform.tfvars        # Values for credentials and environment variables
└── modules/
    └── microservice/       # Reusable module for deploying any app service
        ├── main.tf         # Deploys Deployment, Service, ConfigMap, and Secret
        ├── variables.tf    # Module-level input parameters
        └── outputs.tf      # Exposes internal service name & ports
```

